    "set +e\n# spawn runs task commands under bash -e; `set -uo pipefail` does not clear it (spawn#707).\ncd /tmp\ngrep -E ' (trim\\.sh|check\\.py|ERR2984773_1\\.fastq\\.gz|ERR2984773_2\\.fastq\\.gz|ERR2935805_1\\.fastq\\.gz|ERR2935805_2\\.fastq\\.gz)$' pins.sha256 > pins.sel\n[ \"$(wc -l < pins.sel)\" -eq 6 ] && sha256sum -c pins.sel || { echo \"FAIL: a staged input does not match its pin\"; exit 1; }\nbash trim.sh 16 ERR2984773:8785731:2653290762:full ERR2935805:47832553:9662175706:\n"
  ],
